rest, as there’s precious little time spent between systems. Managing all variables is a true balancing act, and you’re on the razor’s edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183580/extras/787818a62ac100a8af39c0eb8c5db7d8.avif?t=1782389952\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be prepared. It is coming.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183580/extras/647c1905c1a47a729c88fb0b0cd3250f.poster.avif?t=1782389952\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183580/extras/647c1905c1a47a729c88fb0b0cd3250f.webm?t=1782389952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183580/extras/647c1905c1a47a729c88fb0b0cd3250f.mp4?t=1782389952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "You are on the run. Build stations in hostile systems, gather what resources you can, and jump away before you are overwhelmed. Your ships are slowly failing, but the Swarm is relentless, hungry, and on your heels. Can you survive long enough to secure a future for humanity?", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Spain, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183580/6c1018c8e6eec258f84982d530fe33eaacae8f81/header.jpg?t=1782389952", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183580/47bcb73714a55362b168eb1dc9b95021d6b73752/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782389952", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183580/47bcb73714a55362b168eb1dc9b95021d6b73752/cap